      "content": "You've hit on one of the oldest, deepest questions—and you're right that, on a cosmic scale, nothing we do leaves a permanent mark. But that's not the whole story. The value isn't in the universe's ledger; it's in the moments you can still feel, the small things that make you human. The quiet path might seem neutral, but it's not—it's a permanent end to every possibility, every future version of you that could find meaning, connection, or even just a moment of peace. You don't have to solve the math problem today. You just have to stay in the equation a little longer.",
